  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1205.03 Standards of the American Water Works Association",
  "priorExpiration": "2010-04-19",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1205.03 Standards of the American Water Works Association. Devices, products, and methods used in the installation, construction, and operation of treatment, distribution, and storage facilities and all other appurtenances to a PORS shall meet the standards of Env-Dw 407.01, except that any reference to “public water system” shall be deemed to mean “privately owned redistribution system”.\n\nSource. #9572, INTERIM, eff 10-21-09, EXPIRES: 4-19-10; ss by #9660, eff 2-24-10; ss by #12582, eff 7-24-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1200.html"
